					},
					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "ANCHOR POINT\n\nThe Anchor Point node allows you to retrieve the \"origin\" of a geometry based type like Geometry 2D, Slice and Box2D.\n\nThe node will return the anchor point as a Float2.\nIn the case of a Slice the Float2 will be pixel values.\n\nThe Anchor Point is mostly used in conjunction with Geometry nodes and the Transformation node.\n"
					}
				},
